        }
      }
    },
    "写入人像深度与蒙版，Apple“照片”可继续调整景深与焦点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writes portrait depth and mattes so Apple Photos can keep adjusting depth of field and focus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写入摄影风格数据，可在 Apple“照片”中调整色调、颜色和强度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writes Photographic Styles data so tone, color and intensity can be adjusted in Apple Photos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
